      "text": "逆切3"
    },
    {
      "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0002",
      "text": "这是对[读牌技术论6](http://yabejp.web.fc2.com/mahjong/tactics/chapter03/section006.html)、[7](http://yabejp.web.fc2.com/mahjong/tactics/chapter03/section007.html)等内容的补充。"
    },
    {
      "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0003",
      "text": "在[6](http://yabejp.web.fc2.com/mahjong/tactics/chapter03/section006.html)、[7](http://yabejp.web.fc2.com/mahjong/tactics/chapter03/section007.html)中提到过，如果按容易构成面子的牌→不易构成面子的牌的顺序手切，往往能提供很有力的信息。除了[6](http://yabejp.web.fc2.com/mahjong/tactics/chapter03/section006.html)、[7](http://yabejp.web.fc2.com/mahjong/tactics/chapter03/section007.html)中举出的例子，还有很多场合可以运用这一点。"
    },
    {
      "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0005",
      "text": "→"
    },
    {
      "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0007",
      "text": "按这个顺序打出的话，即使是筋张，"
    },
    {
      "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0009",
      "text": "也相当危险；而且，"
    },
    {
      "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0011",
      "text": "被杠，或场上已经能看到4张时，却又打出"
    },
    {
      "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0013",
      "text": "而进入听牌的话，虽说已经形成了壁，"
    },
    {
      "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0015",
      "text": "、"
    },
    {
      "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0017",
      "text": "也很可疑。因为，如果听牌时打出的牌并非作为安全牌保留的，也不是因为进张而打出的，那么其附近就是所听的牌。"
    },
    {
      "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0018",
      "text": "在中张牌之后才打出1、9牌的情况，"
    },
    {
      "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0020",
      "text": "等复合搭子中拆出、因为相对安全而保留之外，还可以考虑另一种情况，即从"
    },
    {
      "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0022",
      "text": "、"
    },
    {
      "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0024",
      "text": "、"
    },
    {
      "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0026",
      "text": "这样的牌形中，"
    },
    {
      "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0028",
      "text": "摸入后，"
    },
    {
      "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0030",
      "text": "被打出的情况。这种情况下，虽然还不能说其附近成为待牌的可能性会升高，但可以说，在其附近构成面子的可能性相当高（因为从复合搭子中拆出时，同样的道理也成立）。"
    },
    {
      "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0031",
      "text": "※红线表示摸切牌"
    },
    {
      "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0033",
      "text": "对家一直保留"
    },
    {
      "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0035",
      "text": "，很可能属于上面举出的情况。若是从"
    },
    {
      "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0037",
      "text": "的牌形中，"
    },
    {
      "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0039",
      "text": "摸入后打出"
    },
    {
      "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0041",
      "text": "，那么"
    },
    {
      "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0043",
      "text": "−"
    },
    {
      "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0045",
      "text": "就是主要应考虑的听牌（实际上对手听的也是"
    },
    {
      "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0047",
      "text": "−"
    },
    {
      "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0049",
      "text": "）；即使并非如此，对家"
    },
    {
      "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0051",
      "text": "至少持有1张的可能性也很大。这样一来，"
    },
    {
      "sourceBlockId": "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0053",
      "text": "最多也只剩2张，继续进攻很勉强。因此应该弃和。"
    }
  ],
  "figures": [
